 ('plq2', 'Another reads the donor inscriptions inside the caves as evidence of many separate patrons over a longer stretch. The dating of individual caves is still argued. What is not in dispute is that this is Vakataka-period work, and that monks, officials and merchants as well as kings are named as donors.'),
